{"step_index":1006,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:34:18Z","thinking":"**Defining Graph Eccentricity**\n\nThe `radius_le_eccentricity` is verified. Now, investigating the `eccentricity` definition. This is defined using `minUpTo` which searches for the smallest `k` where `ballWithin G k v` covers the entire vertex set.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\\n\\nlemma finset_min_getD_le_of_mem (n : ℕ) {s : Finset ℕ} {b : ℕ} (hb : b ∈ s) :\\n    s.min.getD n ≤ b := by\\n  have h : s.min ≤ WithTop.some b := Finset.inf_le hb\\n  cases hm : s.min with\\n  | top =>\\n    rw [hm] at h\\n    simp at h\\n  | coe m =>\\n    rw [hm] at h\\n    exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp h\\n\\nlemma eccentricity_le_of_ballWithin_eq_univ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) (k : ℕ)\\n    (hkle : k ≤ Fintype.card V) (heq : GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v = Finset.univ) :\\n    GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ≤ k := by\\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.eccentricity, GraphCalc.minUpTo]\\n  apply finset_min_getD_le_of_mem (Fintype.card V)\\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\\n  exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hkle, heq⟩\\nEOF\\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Testing eccentricity_le lemma\"","toolSummary":"\"Test eccentricity_le lemma\""}}]}
{"step_index":1007,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:34:22Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:34:22+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 77001943-b7df-4df1-ba5c-db7288bf8e72/task-1007\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\n\nlemma finset_min_getD_le_of_mem (n : ℕ) {s : Finset ℕ} {b : ℕ} (hb : b ∈ s) :\n    s.min.getD n ≤ b := by\n  have h : s.min ≤ WithTop.some b := Finset.inf_le hb\n  cases hm : s.min with\n  | top =>\n    rw [hm] at h\n    simp at h\n  | coe m =>\n    rw [hm] at h\n    exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp h\n\nlemma eccentricity_le_of_ballWithin_eq_univ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) (k : ℕ)\n    (hkle : k ≤ Fintype.card V) (heq : GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v = Finset.univ) :\n    GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ≤ k := by\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.eccentricity, GraphCalc.minUpTo]\n  apply finset_min_getD_le_of_mem (Fintype.card V)\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\n  exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hkle, heq⟩\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.wwbf9z/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/77001943-b7df-4df1-ba5c-db7288bf8e72/.system_generated/tasks/task-1007.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
