{"step_index":1032,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:35:23Z","thinking":"**Examining `min_getD_eq_min'` lemma**\n\nThe lemma `min_getD_eq_min'` relates the minimum element of a nonempty finset `s` to the `getD` function, which provides a default value. It seems a straightforward equivalence between two ways to express the minimum. The proof uses `Finset.coe_min'` to rewrite the left-hand side, and concludes with `rfl`.\n\n**Considering the next lemma**\n\nNow, the focus shifts to `exists_totalDominatingSet_card_eq`, which likely deals with the existence of a total dominating set in a graph, and relating it to cardinality. This will require working with graph theory concepts, and it seems to involve a `SimpleGraph V` and a `Fintype V`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nlemma exists_totalDominatingSet_card_eq {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\\n    (ht : GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber G) :\\n    ∃ s : Finset V, GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G s ∧ s.card = GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber G := by\\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber, GraphCalc.HasWitness] at ht\\n  rcases ht with ⟨s0, hs0mem, hs0dom⟩\\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber, GraphCalc.minCard]\\n  have hne : s0.card ∈ Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset) := by\\n    apply Finset.mem_image.mpr\\n    refine ⟨s0, ?_, rfl⟩\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\\n    exact ⟨hs0mem, hs0dom⟩\\n  have hnonempty : (Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset)).Nonempty := ⟨s0.card, hne⟩\\n  have hmin := Finset.min'_mem _ hnonempty\\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hmin\\n  rcases hmin with ⟨s, hs, hscard⟩\\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hs\\n  refine ⟨s, hs.2, ?_⟩\\n  rw [hscard]\\n  exact (min_getD_eq_min' hnonempty 0).symm\\nEOF\\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Testing exists_totalDominatingSet\"","toolSummary":"\"Test exists_totalDominatingSet lemma\""}}]}
{"step_index":1033,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:35:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:35:26+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 77001943-b7df-4df1-ba5c-db7288bf8e72/task-1033\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nlemma exists_totalDominatingSet_card_eq {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n    (ht : GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber G) :\n    ∃ s : Finset V, GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G s ∧ s.card = GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber G := by\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber, GraphCalc.HasWitness] at ht\n  rcases ht with ⟨s0, hs0mem, hs0dom⟩\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber, GraphCalc.minCard]\n  have hne : s0.card ∈ Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset) := by\n    apply Finset.mem_image.mpr\n    refine ⟨s0, ?_, rfl⟩\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\n    exact ⟨hs0mem, hs0dom⟩\n  have hnonempty : (Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset)).Nonempty := ⟨s0.card, hne⟩\n  have hmin := Finset.min'_mem _ hnonempty\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hmin\n  rcases hmin with ⟨s, hs, hscard⟩\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hs\n  refine ⟨s, hs.2, ?_⟩\n  rw [hscard]\n  exact (min_getD_eq_min' hnonempty 0).symm\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.wwbf9z/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/77001943-b7df-4df1-ba5c-db7288bf8e72/.system_generated/tasks/task-1033.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
